<title>BOSNIA: Bosnia June retail prices up 0.2 pct m/m, 13.0 y/y.</title>
<headline>Bosnia June retail prices up 0.2 pct m/m, 13.0 y/y.</headline>
<dateline>SARAJEVO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Bureau of Bosnia's Moslem-Croat federation issued the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    BOSNIA RETAIL PRICES		 JUNE    MAY    JUNE 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)		  +0.2   +2.9    -0.5</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		  +13.0  +13.7   -27.6</p>
<p>NOTES -- The data cover 51 percent of Bosnia-Hercegovina territory. Data for remaining 49 percent are not available. Retail prices in Jan-June 1997 rose 11.9 percent compared to the same period in 1996, the office said. -- Sarajevo newsroom, +387-71-663-864.</p>
</text>
